3. Corner handling in ChFi3d_FilBuilder.hxx, with its access level:
  ChFi3d_FilBuilder.hxx:359 [protected] Standard_EXPORT void PerformTwoCorner(const int Index) override;
  ChFi3d_FilBuilder.hxx:361 [protected] Standard_EXPORT void PerformThreeCorner(const int Index) override;
  ChFi3d_FilBuilder.hxx:363 [protected] Standard_EXPORT void ExtentOneCorner(const TopoDS_Vertex&              V,
  ChFi3d_FilBuilder.hxx:366 [protected] Standard_EXPORT void ExtentTwoCorner(
  ChFi3d_FilBuilder.hxx:370 [protected] Standard_EXPORT void ExtentThreeCorner(
  Notes: ChFi3d_Builder::PerformTwoCornerbyInter(Index) is public but is a step of the
  builder's own corner computation (ChFi3d_FilBuilder_C2.cxx calls it from PerformTwoCorner
  when the two strips intersect; Index is the builder's internal vertex index), not a choice of
  corner. BRepFilletAPI_MakeFillet keeps its ChFi3d_FilBuilder private (its Builder() returns
  the TopOpeBRepBuild_HBuilder), so none of these is reachable through the fillet API; changing
  a corner means subclassing ChFi3d_FilBuilder and writing its corner surfaces.

4. ChFi3d_FilletShape (the only shape option of MakeFillet):
  //! Lists the types of fillet shapes. These include the following:
  //! -   ChFi3d_Rational (default value), which is the
  //! standard NURBS representation of circles,
  //! -   ChFi3d_QuasiAngular, which is a NURBS
  //! representation of circles where the parameters
  //! match those of the circle,
  //! -   ChFi3d_Polynomial, which corresponds to a
  //! polynomial approximation of circles. This type
  //! facilitates the implementation of the construction algorithm.
    ChFi3d_Rational,
    ChFi3d_QuasiAngular,
    ChFi3d_Polynomial

